```
Then, we can calculate the normalized version of $\vec{z}_3$ as $\vec{q}_3=\begin{bmatrix}-\frac{59}{\sqrt{3706}} \\ \frac{15}{\sqrt{3706}}\end{bmatrix}$, represented below:
