>>to [R, R=$R_p$] (4.5, -0.75)
>>(4.5,-1.5) |- (4.5, -1.25) to [closing switch, l_=$V_{GS} \leq -|V_{tp}|$] (4.5, -0.75);
>>\node at (4.5, -1.75) {D};
>>\node at (4.5, 1.5) {S};
>>\node at (3.5, -1.75) {G};
>>\end{circuitikz}
>>\end{document}
>>```

> [!example] CMOS Inverter & Ring Oscillator Paradox
