##### *(Rule of Thumb)* A finite strategic form game has an odd number of total NEs and at most one mixed strategy Nash equilibrium.
A more elaborate table of this can be seen below:

| Pure NEs | Mixed NEs |
| :------: | :-------: |
|    2     |     1     |
